n.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by any merchant that has the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Table\" title=\"Potion Table\">Potion Table</a> <em>starting at level 9</em></li>\n<li>Sold by:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/25px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/38px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/50px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Omeluum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/25px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\">Omeluum</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vicar_Humbletoes\" title=\"Vicar Humbletoes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/25px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/38px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/50px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vicar Humbletoes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/25px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vicar_Humbletoes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vicar Humbletoes\">Vicar Humbletoes</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Cerebrospinal_Fluid\" title=\"Suspension of Cerebrospinal Fluid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png/40px-Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Suspension_of_Mergrass_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Cerebrospinal_Fluid\" title=\"Suspension of Cerebrospinal Fluid\">Suspension of Cerebrospinal Fluid</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum\" title=\"Intellect Devourer Cerebellum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png/20px-Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png/30px-Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png/40px-Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png/20px-Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer_Cerebellum\" title=\"Intellect Devourer Cerebellum\">Intellect Devourer Cerebellum</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Sublimate</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 110px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 108px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elixir_of_Psychic_Resistance_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Elixir_of_Psychic_Resistance_Model.png/162px-Elixir_of_Psychic_Resistance_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Elixir_of_Psychic_Resistance_Model.png/244px-Elixir_of_Psychic_Resistance_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thu